  "title": "🎲 Digiwise Gamejam Weekend",
  "date": "2025-11-01T22:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "🎲 Digiwise Gamejam Weekend\n\nThis weekend, I had the pleasure of mentoring at Shokkin’s Digiwise Gamejam 💡\n\n\n\nThe jam focused on tabletop board games, exploring two meaningful themes: 🧠 media literacy and 💬 cyberbullying awareness.\n\n\n\nAfter two intense days of creativity and teamwork, each group presented a fully developed board game — and the results were amazing! 🙌\n\n\n\nI was especially happy to see teams experiment beyond traditional card-based RPGs — some went for map-based mechanics and even tile-placement strategies. 🗺️✨\n\nA weekend full of learning, creativity, and great people ❤️",
  "category": {
    "label": "life",
    "href": "/life"
  },
